  "details": "Before the PhysBones Update, there was a feature to disable/limit Dynamic Bones. Since the Physbones Update, this feature is gone and Worlds with over 50+ people become a struggle. It would be great to have this feature back for Physbones or even better: \nto have it in the security settings to disable/enable Physbones for certain usergroups. Because sometimes it's just one Avatar that could hurt the experience by having over 1000 collisions (unfortunatly not exaggerated). \nMy only option right now is to activate safety mode and dance with an army of robots.",
